flowchart LR
  context["<b>Current text</b><br/><small>The prompt plus tokens accepted so far is the starting point for each round.</small>"]
  draft["<b>Draft k tokens</b><br/><small>The tiny draft model generates k candidate tokens one by one; each step is cheap.</small>"]
  verify["<b>Verify in one pass</b><br/><small>The 7B target scores all k drafted positions in a single parallel forward pass.</small>"]
  compare["<b>Compare token by token</b><br/><small>Each draft token is accepted if the target agrees, with a probability test when sampling.</small>"]
  accept["<b>Keep accepted prefix</b><br/><small>Accepted tokens are appended. At the first rejection, the target's own token replaces the draft's.</small>"]
  speed["<b>Speedup depends on α, k, cost</b><br/><small>Higher acceptance and cheaper drafts mean more tokens per target pass. Too long a k wastes draft work.</small>"]
  context --> draft
  draft -->|k tokens| verify
  verify --> compare
  compare -->|accept/reject| accept
  accept -.->|next round| context
  accept --> speed
  style context fill:#00a85a,color:#fff,stroke:#00a85a
